# Cross-origin isolation so wllama can use multi-threaded WASM
# (SharedArrayBuffer) for local embeddings — 2-4x faster where WebGPU is off.
# `credentialless` (not `require-corp`) keeps cross-origin favicons working.
# Do not remove: without these, WASM falls back to a single thread.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
